OL,3,C'Britain is a tinderbox': Burnham sets
OL,4,Cout plan to battle wildfires
OL,6,FThe prime minister has warned that
OL,7,F"Britain is a tinderbox" as he set out
OL,8,Fhis response to the devastating
OL,9,Fwildfires across the UK.
OL,11,FAndy Burnham has called in the
OL,12,Fmilitary in South Wales, announced a
OL,13,Fban on disposable barbecues and urged
OL,14,Fsmokers to take care when disposing of
OL,15,Fcigarette butts.
OL,17,FThe PM also revealed he planned to
OL,18,Fcommission firefighting planes, which
OL,19,Fare commonly used to douse flames in
OL,20,FEurope, the US and other countries to
OL,21,Fcombat the spread of wildfires.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/9
