OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1786839481
OL,3,C'Britain is a tinderbox': Burnham sets
OL,4,Cout plan to battle wildfires
OL,6,FHe was speaking during a visit to
OL,7,FStourbridge in the West Midlands,
OL,8,Fwhere fires have torn through houses.
OL,10,FSo far, 19 houses have been destroyed
OL,11,Fand a further 18 damaged by the
OL,12,Fwildfire, according to West Midlands
OL,13,FFire Service Chief Simon Tuhill.
OL,15,FBurnham said plans were being drawn up
OL,16,Ffor emergency financial support for
OL,17,Ffire services battling the spread of
OL,18,Fwildfires.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
