FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31003
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1786839481
OL,3,C'Britain is a tinderbox': Burnham sets
OL,4,Cout plan to battle wildfires
OL,6,FHe told broadcasters: "I've never seen
OL,7,Fscenes like this in Britain, where you
OL,8,Fjust see a whole house gutted,
OL,9,Fsmouldering."
OL,11,FHe also confirmed that 100 military
OL,12,Fpersonnel had been deployed to a blaze
OL,13,Fin South Wales to offer "critically
OL,14,Fneeded" support.
OL,16,FFurthermore, the government has
OL,17,Fappointed Baroness Blake of Leeds as
OL,18,Ffire minister, a new post in the
OL,19,FMinistry of Housing, Communities and
OL,20,FLocal Government.
OL,26,@nD@WOUqD@MO]uD@YOUvD@GO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/9
