PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1786839481
OL,3,C'Britain is a tinderbox': Burnham sets
OL,4,Cout plan to battle wildfires
OL,6,FThe PM warned "Britain is a tinderbox
OL,7,Fright now" with "37 fires smouldering
OL,8,Faround the country".
OL,10,FThere have been more than 1,000
OL,11,Fwildfires recorded across the country
OL,12,Fthis year.
OL,14,FHe went on to acknowledge the lack of
OL,15,Faerial firefighting capabilities and
OL,16,Fsaid that they would be commissioned
OL,17,Ffor national use.
OL,26,@nD@OOUoD@JO]oD@QOUpD@SO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/9
