OL,3,C'Britain is a tinderbox': Burnham sets
OL,4,Cout plan to battle wildfires
OL,6,FBurnham also promised a summit with
OL,7,Ffire services as he said they have not
OL,8,Freceived the funding required to cope
OL,9,Fwith the impacts of climate change,
OL,10,Fincluding the possibility of floods
OL,11,Flater in the year.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
