OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1786839481
OL,3,C'Britain is a tinderbox': Burnham sets
OL,4,Cout plan to battle wildfires
OL,6,F"I can't say today that we've done
OL,7,Fenough to fully resource them to deal
OL,8,Fwith these type of incidents, and I
OL,9,Fwant our firefighters to know that I
OL,10,Funderstand how it seems from their
OL,11,Fpoint of view, and I'm going to
OL,12,Fconvene that summit to make sure we
OL,13,Fget in place the right support,
OL,14,Fincluding the aerial support,
OL,15,Fpermanently if that is what they deem
OL,16,Fis needed," he said.
OL,18,F"Obviously, there's other adjustments
OL,19,Fthat we need to make in relation to
OL,20,Fclimate change."
OL,26,@nD@AOUxD@KO]zD@AOU|D@PO]
