OL,3,C'Britain is a tinderbox': Burnham sets
OL,4,Cout plan to battle wildfires
OL,6,FHe said experts had warned the UK
OL,7,Fcould face a wet autumn and winter
OL,8,Fbecause of the El Nino effect "so,
OL,9,Fafter fire could come floods".
