OL,3,C'Britain is a tinderbox': Burnham sets
OL,4,Cout plan to battle wildfires
OL,6,FTemperatures provisionally reached
OL,7,F38.1C at Kew Gardens in London on
OL,8,FThursday, the second time this year
OL,9,Fthe country has seen temperatures hit
OL,10,F38C.
OL,12,FThe UK Health Security Agency (UKHSA)
OL,13,Fhas extended the current amber heat
OL,14,Fhealth alert for the East Midlands,
OL,15,FWest Midlands, South East, South West,
OL,16,FLondon and East of England until 10am
OL,17,Fon Saturday.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/9
